`packages/types/src/complex.ts` contained two `DashboardSchema extends BaseSchema` declarations with incompatible `widgets` property types, causing TS2717 and blocking the entire build pipeline.

- **Root cause**: Legacy declaration (inline widget type with required `id`/`component`) conflicted with the newer `DashboardWidgetSchema[]` declaration (optional `id`/`component`, plus `type`/`options` for spec shorthand)
- **Fix**: Removed the legacy declaration; the remaining one already supports both formats via `DashboardWidgetSchema`

```ts
// Before: two conflicting interface declarations
interface DashboardSchema extends BaseSchema {
  widgets: Array<{ id: string; component: SchemaNode; ... }>  // line 24
}
interface DashboardSchema extends BaseSchema {
  widgets: DashboardWidgetSchema[]  // line 526 — TS2717
}

// After: single declaration
interface DashboardSchema extends BaseSchema {
  widgets: DashboardWidgetSchema[]  // id/component optional, supports spec shorthand
}
```

